    "common_rows": "Within each case all four models use identical training months; test calendar identical across targets and cases",
    "strict_monthly_exposure": "Outcome index and annual base, two released IIP lag indices and annual bases, monthly and annual-base electricity windows and both weekly windows; drop row on any shock contact",
